                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style=";text-align:center;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:27px;font-family:方正小标宋简体;color:#333333">关于开展9月支部主题党日活动的通知</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:#333333"> </span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#333333">各支部：</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:36px"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋_GB2312">9</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月是第二批学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育的启动之月，也是杭州亚运会举办之月，为更好发挥党支部的战斗堡垒作用和党员的先锋模范作用，结合我校实际，经研究，决定组织开展9月支部主题党日活动，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">一、活动主题</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">凝聚思想，落实行动，亚运有我</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">二、活动形式</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">集中学习</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">三、活动时间</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:#333333">9</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#333333">月12日-14日第九节</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">四、活动地点</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">各支部活动室</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">五、活动内容</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">学习重要理论</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">学习动员：开展第二批学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育动员；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">文本学习：习近平总书记对党的建设和组织工作的重要指示批示精神，领悟党的建设“十三个坚持”内涵；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">视频学习：习近平总书记在首个全国生态日作出的重要指示精神；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">文本学习：市委九届四次全会精神。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">组建“亚运有我”党员先锋服务队</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">各支部要号召全体党员教师以更高的站位护航亚运、为国争光，以更实的作风奉献亚运、勇当先锋，以更美的笑容迎接亚运、展示风采，以更“潮”的思想宣传亚运，讲好浙江故事，传播中国好声音，积极动员支部党员加入学校党员先锋服务队，各支部于9月15日前将名单通过钉钉报给党政办金笛。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">3.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">参观绍兴市党史教育基地巡礼展</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">为纪念中共绍兴（党、团）地方支部（绍兴第一个共产党组织）成立 100 周年，绍兴市委党史研究室策划举办绍兴市党史教育基地巡礼展，展示绍兴 11 家省级党史教育基地和66 家市级党史教育基地的风采，旨在用伟大成就激励人，用伟大精神教育人，用成功经验启迪人，为绍兴人民秉持“胆剑精神”，图更强、争一流、敢首创，勇闯中国式现代化市域实践的新路子，提供前行的智慧与力量；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">展出日期：截至 2023 年 9 月中旬；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">开放时间：9：00-16：30（周一闭馆，节假日正常开放）；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">展出地点：越城区府山横街 270 号（府山公园南门内）中共绍兴历史展陈（馆）；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">参观预约电话：0575-85121191，13567210480；</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">各支部可结合自身工作实际，自行组织前往参观；团体参观请提前预约，参观现场请服从工作人员安排,参观全程佩戴口罩；参观结束后两日内将参观过程照片及合影通过钉钉发给党政办金笛。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">4.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">积极动员无偿献血</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">本次献血安排时间段为24日前，请各支部做好动员工作，于9月15日前将报名党员名单通过钉钉报给党政办金笛，献血的具体时间地点另行通知。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">5.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:楷体_GB2312;color:black">落实基础党建工作</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">针对2023年7月-9月“两学一做”记录本开展党员自查、支部书记检查、校党委抽查（抽查时间为9月25日-26日）。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><strong><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 黑体;color:#333333;font-weight:normal">六、注意事项</span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:black">1.</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">各支部要结合实际制定支部主题党日活动方案并组织好活动，注重形式的多样性。同时，严肃组织纪律，按要求在《组织生活记录本》上做好签到和记录工作，<span style="text-decoration:underline;">图文资料及签到表发给党政办存档（9月15日前）</span>。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:black">2.</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">各位党员教师要规范佩戴党徽，准时参加活动，并在《党员笔记》上做好记录。当周“每周一学”活动可结合主题党日活动开展。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:black">3.</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:black">请各位党员自觉开展<span style="text-decoration:underline;">“学习强国”</span>学习平台中有关内容的学习，并<span style="text-decoration:underline;">及时缴纳9月党费</span>。</span></p><p style=";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:43px;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family: 仿宋;color:black"> </span></p><p style=";text-align:right;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#333333">中共绍兴市第一中学委员会</span></p><p style=";text-align:right;line-height:36px;background:white"><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#333333">2023</span><span style="font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#333333">年9月11日    </span></p><p>
</p>
    
